      "message": "Reference Model: Handle MDCFG improper seetings when IOPMP is enabled\n\nThe IOPMP specification v0.8.2 relaxes the restrictions on MDCFG\nimproper settings that MDCFG table can have improper settings when IOPMP\nhas not been enabled yet. The automatic update of MDCFG improper settings\nis triggered when HWCFG0.enable is set or during the runtime.",
